  "title": "Renuvion Wins 2026 NewBeauty Award For “Best Minimally Invasive Skin Tightner”",
  "summary": "CLEARWATER,Fla., April 1, 2026/PRNewswire/- Apyx® Medical Corporation (NASDAQ: APYX) (\"Apyx Medical\" or the \"Company\"), the leader in surgical aesthetics marketed and sold as Renuvion® and the AYON Body Contouring System™ (AYON), today announced that Renuvion has been named this year’s NewBeauty Award winner in the \"Best Minimally Invasive Skin Tightener\"1 category for the second [...] The post Renuvion Wins 2026 NewBeauty Award For “Best Minimally Invasive Skin Tightner” appeared first on Apyx Medical .",
